post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> underscore installed.  Quick start:

    1. (Optional, for --menu-policy always/pause) In Forza Horizon enable
       Data Out:  Settings -> HUD & Gameplay -> Data Out = ON,
       IP 127.0.0.1, Port 5335.
    2. Find your music player name:   underscore players
    3. Find the game audio monitor:   underscore sources
    4. Run it:
         underscore run --player spotify --game-monitor <name-from-sources>

    The default --menu-policy 'speech' ducks on detected dialogue and needs
    no telemetry.  Settings persist to ~/.config/underscore/config.toml.
    The Silero model ships at /usr/share/underscore/silero_vad.onnx.

    Prefer a window?  Launch "Underscore" from your app menu, or run:
         underscore-gui
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  :
}
